s://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2020-08-05T10:37:15Z","updated_at":"2020-10-10T01:04:52Z","closed_at":"2020-08-10T07:17:11Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Question\r\nI have generated clearkey encrypted DASH content with key-rotation using shaka-packager and hosted it on a media server.\r\nI have configured license server with all keys used for encryption.\r\nThen I added entry for this content in exoplayer's media.exolist.json file as below:\r\n```\r\n{\r\n        \"name\": \"ClearKey_KeyRotation_sample\",\r\n        \"uri\": \"http://<media-server-ip-address>/shaka_clearkey/h264.mpd\",\r\n        \"drm_scheme\": \"clearkey\",\r\n        \"drm_license_url\": \"http://<license-server-ip-address>/clearkey-server/AcquireLicense\",\r\n        \"drm_multi_session\": true\r\n }\r\n```\r\nIf only video stream is selected for playback with no audio stream, video plays fully by acquiring all required keys from license server.\r\nBut when audio stream is selected along with/without video stream, playback fails after 6 seconds.\r\nWhen audio stream is selected and played in exoplayer and playback is seeked to any particular timestamp of the content, corresponding key is acquired by exoplayer from license server correctly. But playback immediately fails.\r\n\r\nKey rotation dash content:\r\n[key_rotation_sample.zip](https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/files/5027747/key_rotation_sample.zip)\r\n\r\nKeys used for content encryption:\r\nKID: 59766957-2e55-547e-656b-56586e2f6f68,\tKey: 7959493a764556786527517849756635\r\nKID: 7669572E-5554-7E65-6B56-586E2F6F6859,\tKey: 59493a76455678652751784975663579\r\n\r\nAdditional information:\r\nThis content plays on shaka player with both audio and video without any issues.\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mkcdot","id":68843485,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNDg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843485?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot","html_url":"https://github.com/mkcdot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7716/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}